  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tAccounts Production\n\t\tAccounts Production Help Guide\n\n### How to Import a Trial Balance from FreeAgent\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Tue, 25 Jul, 2023 at  9:20 AM\n\n\t\tPlease click here to watch the video guide\n\nLocation: Accounts Production > Tasks > Trial Balance > Mode of Import: FreeAgent \n\nRefer to the link\n\nHelp/Guide:\n\nOnce in Accounts production, navigate to a client workspace. Once there, head to Tasks > Trial Balance and click the + icon to create a new Trial Balance.\n\nNext, enter a description, choose between Annual/Management, choose the Accounting Period and tick FreeAgent for the mode of import. Once you click 'create' you will be redirected to FreeAgent, where you will need to enter your credentials and select a company to import from. \n\nThe final step is to map the entries to Capium's Chart of Accounts. If a particular code isn't available in Capium, use the '+Add Account' option to create a new account.\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
  "bodyHtml": "\n\t<div class=\"breadcrumb\">\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions\"> Solution home </a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/9000115345\">Accounts Production</a>\n\t\t<a href=\"/support/solutions/folders/9000188540\">Accounts Production Help Guide</a>\n\t</div>\n\t<b class=\"page-stamp page-stamp-article\">\n\t\t<b class=\"icon-page-article\"></b>\n\t</b>\n\n\t<h2 class=\"heading\">How to Import a Trial Balance from FreeAgent\n\t \t<a href=\"#\"\n            class=\"solution-print--icon print--remove\"\n \t\t\ttitle=\"Print this Article\"\n \t\t\tarial-role=\"link\"\n \t\t\tarial-label=\"Print this Article\"\n\t\t\tid=\"print-article\"\n \t\t>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"icon-print\"></span>\n\t\t\t<span class=\"text-print\">Print</span>\n \t\t</a>\n\t</h2>\n\t\n\t<p>Modified on: Tue, 25 Jul, 2023 at  9:20 AM</p>\n\t<hr />\n\t\n\n\t<article class=\"article-body\" id=\"article-body\" rel=\"image-enlarge\">\n\t\t<p data-identifyelement=\"501\" dir=\"ltr\"><a data-identifyelement=\"502\" href=\"https://www.loom.com/share/dbfd1a378fc94e1e9679804ff4f0e931?sid=fea7d08b-e254-4ac1-a926-34bffbd41f13\">Please click here to watch the video guide</a></p><p data-identifyelement=\"505\"><br></p><p><span class=\"fr-video fr-deletable fr-fvc fr-dvb fr-draggable\"></span></p><div style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: NaN%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/dbfd1a378fc94e1e9679804ff4f0e931?sid=f7cfa579-6f6f-4ded-8b25-5c2c93a94018\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\"></iframe></div><p></p><div class=\"fr-draggable\" data-identifyelement=\"507\" style=\"position: relative; padding-bottom: NaN%; height: 0;\"><iframe src=\"https://www.loom.com/embed/dbfd1a378fc94e1e9679804ff4f0e931?sid=cad37f06-b869-445e-908e-d72f4d0379ce\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-forms allow-same-origin allow-presentation\" data-identifyelement=\"508\"></iframe></div><p data-identifyelement=\"502\" dir=\"ltr\"><strong data-identifyelement=\"503\" dir=\"ltr\">Location:</strong> Accounts Production &gt; Tasks &gt; Trial Balance &gt; Mode of Import: FreeAgent&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"504\"><a data-identifyelement=\"505\" href=\"https://app.capium.com/accounts/tasks/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Refer to the link</a></p><p data-identifyelement=\"509\"><br data-identifyelement=\"510\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"511\" dir=\"ltr\">Help/Guide:</p><p data-identifyelement=\"512\">Once in Accounts production, navigate to a client workspace. Once there, head to Tasks &gt; Trial Balance and click the + icon to create a new Trial Balance.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"513\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9084805444/original/DkvIXhKBVGq_juvjk8C7UoHWMgFL8TJ7Pw.png?1567072122\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9084805444/original/DkvIXhKBVGq_juvjk8C7UoHWMgFL8TJ7Pw.png?1567072122\" data-fileid=\"9084805444\" data-uniquekey=\"1567071800816\" style=\"width: 840px;\" data-identifyelement=\"514\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"515\"><br data-identifyelement=\"516\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"517\">Next, enter a description, choose between Annual/Management, choose the Accounting Period and tick <span data-identifyelement=\"509\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">FreeAgent</span> for the mode of import. Once you click 'create' you will be redirected to <span data-identifyelement=\"510\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: -apple-system, &quot;system-ui&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 400; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; display: inline !important;\">FreeAgent</span>, where you will need to enter your credentials and select a company to import from.&nbsp;</p><p data-identifyelement=\"517\"><br data-identifyelement=\"511\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"517\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9191680834/original/YHv2qhjfd26oms3DcgP479tpntqWAdsL7Q.png?1690273054\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9191680834\" data-identifyelement=\"512\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"520\"><br data-identifyelement=\"521\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"522\">The final step is to map the entries to Capium's Chart of Accounts. If a particular code isn't available in Capium, use the '+Add Account' option to create a new account.</p><p data-identifyelement=\"523\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9084805997/original/ngLXpW7G30gtKSFxhbV6PARZmFI6gJxoLA.png?1567072618\" class=\"fr-fic fr-dib fr-fil\" data-filelink=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9084805997/original/ngLXpW7G30gtKSFxhbV6PARZmFI6gJxoLA.png?1567072618\" data-fileid=\"9084805997\" data-uniquekey=\"1567071800816\" style=\"width: 839px;\" data-identifyelement=\"524\"></p><p data-identifyelement=\"529\"><br data-identifyelement=\"530\"></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000230408\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000230408/thumbs_up\" class=\"vote